# The Castle's any-color mana is for artifact spells only (CR 106.6). Bot1 has two Castles: on turn 3 the first is tapped for {R} (restricted) and Mox Pearl and Mox Sapphire
# stay untapped, with an Ornithopter to sacrifice. The pool is {R} (ArtifactSpells) and two unrestricted mana, three in all, yet:
#   - Lightning Bolt (needs {R}, a Mox makes only {W} or {U}) is not offered: restricted mana can't cast a nonartifact spell;
#   - the second Castle's "{3}, {T}, Sacrifice an artifact" is not offered: restricted mana can't pay an activation, so only two of the three mana count.
# A free Mox Jet then supplies the third unrestricted mana and the very same activation is offered (the positive control) and makes a Doombot.

[Bot1 Deck]
Castle Doom
Castle Doom
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Castle Doom.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Castle Doom.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Castle Doom.Activate(Ability: any color; Color: Red)
? Bot1.Mana = {R} (ArtifactSpells)
! Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2; Mana: short)
! Bot1.Battlefield.Castle Doom#2.Activate(Ability: Doombot; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Castle Doom#2.Activate(Ability: Doombot)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Tap Castle Doom)
Bot1.Choose(Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana = {R} (ArtifactSpells)
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Castle Doom; Castle Doom; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Doombot
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Life = 20
Stack.Count = 0
